  "body": "## What changed\n\nMap healed wire offsets to arc positions on their input profiles.\nHold each excised span at its trim vertex.\nUse surviving offset segments to widen healed corners.\nKeep the surface checks against the unhealed product.\n\n## Cause\n\nPairing used the shortened offset lengths after one plane healed a corner.\nThis moved the two planes out of phase.\nWidening directions from removed input edges could also reverse a step.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe fixture pairs 0.164 mm and 0.300 mm fillets at a 0.165 mm kerf offset.\nBoth arc-length fan pins failed on unchanged code before the fix.\nAll 11 pins now pass:\n\n- `uniform_arc_length_sews_an_asymmetric_trimmed_fillet_as_a_fan`\n- `per_ruling_arc_length_sews_an_asymmetric_trimmed_fillet_as_a_fan`\n- `sync_points_inside_excised_fillets_hold_the_trim_vertices`\n- `trimmed_preimages_do_not_depend_on_the_input_seam_or_winding`\n- `a_deep_slot_still_refuses_by_name_before_emitting_a_path`\n- `clearance_detects_a_midheight_gouge_even_when_both_plane_rings_clear`\n- `a_parallel_that_walks_the_source_twice_has_no_monotone_preimage`\n- `distinct_offset_vertices_cannot_share_one_input_arc_position`\n- `input_arc_coordinates_interpolate_the_surviving_flank`\n- `input_arc_coordinates_project_the_surviving_flank`\n- `subdividing_a_surviving_edge_does_not_hide_an_excised_fillet`\n\nThe emitted rulings pass folds, crossing, lean, and clearance at all 33 heights.\nThe deep-slot test also checks a gouge strictly between the two planes.\n\nMutation results:\n\n- Old uniform pairing: red. Restored fix: green.\n- Old per-ruling pairing: red. Restored fix: green.\n- Old widening directions: red with a fold. Restored fix: green.\n- Old input-coordinate interpolation: red at X6 instead of X5. Restored fix: green.\n- Old input-coordinate projection: red at arc 4 instead of arc 5. Restored fix: green.\n- Disabled monotone-turn guard: red. Restored guard: green.\n- Disabled conflicting-knot guard: red. Restored guard: green.\n- Count-only healing detection: red after a straight-edge subdivision. Source-edge detection: green.\n\nThe old pairing file needed only a field-visibility change to compile the coordinate mutations.\nThat change did not change its behavior.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 12 steps.\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed without warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo physical machine run or release gate.\nThe map refuses an unsupported or non-monotone source match by name.\nThe existing cover limit still refuses deep healed slots before emission.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nEffort: max\n\nChangelog: Wire EDM XYUV keeps fan rulings aligned when an offset removes an input span.\n\nFixes #2694\n",
